     "body": "<p>The attached demonstrates a non-production resolution of the issue.<br/>\nHowever, since we can not rely on the presence of &lt;resources&gt;/fcr:metadata, the metadata resource should be determined in a fashion similar to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-message-consumer/blob/master/fcrepo-message-consumer-core/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/indexer/RdfRetriever.java#L75-L90\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-message-consumer/blob/master/fcrepo-message-consumer-core/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/indexer/RdfRetriever.java#L75-L90</a></p>",
